Third-party runtime dependency
--------------------------------

koffi (https://koffi.dev/)
  License: MIT
  Used as the Node-API FFI loader for the shared libxyg_core C ABI.
  Copyright and license terms for koffi are those of its upstream project;
  install metadata is declared in this package's package.json dependencies.

Exact-platform optional packages
--------------------------------

Native binaries for supported OS/arch pairs ship as separate optional packages
(@curatelabs/xyg-node-darwin-arm64, darwin-x64, linux-x64, linux-arm64,
win32-x64). Each carries its own NOTICE and Apache-2.0 license declaration.
Windows arm64 is intentionally unsupported.
